{
  "readme": [
    "The body corpus: what the QML renderer's DynamicForm sends, byte for byte, for typed text.",
    "Written by src/qt/forms/tests/tst_BodyCorpus.qml (MORPH_FORMS_WRITE_BODY_CORPUS=1 regenerates",
    "every body from a real DynamicForm); without the variable that suite requires the committed",
    "bodies. tests/test_forms_engine_corpora.cpp requires the forms engine to send the same bytes.",
    "",
    "A case: 'schema' (JSON text), 'locale' (C or de_DE), 'offset' (display zone, minutes east of UTC),",
    "optional 'prefill' (JSON text, loaded first), 'steps' (each sets one field's text, after",
    "selecting 'unit' when given), and 'body': the body sent, or null when the form is not ready."
  ],
